SUMMARY:Trial of the Bastion
DESCRIPTION:Talalikhin\, an adventurer dedicated to studying dangerous phenomena\, has devised a new training simulation after compiling intelligence from various factions. This simulation is engineered to hone adventurers' skills in constructing defensive works and holding the line against formidable foes with firearms.
